caption: Creating and Classifying Souls

Creating Souls: Any being with the Godsoul advantage can spend 10,000 experience to create 10,000 higher souls or one million lower souls; this must be done in batches this large. The souls are then released to the area around the god, allowing new people and animals to be born. Created souls cannot be directly placed into an afterlife; that’s why it is called that. They must be alive first. Created souls can be directly placed in a construct, the first part of creating life, but such souls are worth no points through the experience gain section.

Higher Souls: All people have higher souls, and are capable of worship and granting powers to a God.

Lower Souls: Animals have lower souls. They do not participate in any of these experience loops except Sacrifice, and always naturally reincarnate to their local planet if possible. Creatures with a lower soul cannot have an IQ higher than 5,
